{
  "_about": [
    "Every image a release publishes, as published-name -> the Dockerfile that builds it.",
    "Read by three places that must agree: .github/workflows/publish-images.yml (the build matrix),",
    "container-images.json in the release (the digest manifest every deployment pins), and",
    "desktop/src-tauri/src/harness.rs's every_image_is_one_a_release_publishes.",
    "The registry path is derived from the name: `ccpbot` stays as it is (the all-in-one image the",
    "Kubernetes chart serves every role from), everything else is prefixed, so `server` is published",
    "as ghcr.io/<owner>/ccpbot-server and `agent-crewai` as ghcr.io/<owner>/ccpbot-agent-crewai."
  ],
